(7129024, 1091037, 129147, '<td valign="top">7. I like the processing, wished for less sky and more water.</td>', '7. I like the processing, wished for less sky and more water.', '2013-11-13 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129036, 1091812, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very familiar scene, setup and processing. Looks much like Bear''s imaging. Lovely serene take</td>', 'Very familiar scene, setup and processing. Looks much like Bear''s imaging. Lovely serene take', '2013-11-13 02:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129068, 1091829, 100773, '<td valign="top">This has a poor quality look on it, but the colors are borderline crazy in a good way. Composition is also good. 6 from  me.</td>', 'This has a poor quality look on it, but the colors are borderline crazy in a good way. Composition is also good. 6 from  me.', '2013-11-13 05:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129069, 1091728, 100773, '<td valign="top">The story here is very good, the retouching ruins it for my part. I would''ve gone for a cleaner black and white, and added more drama with darkening the sky, sea, and corners. Easily done with curves and layer mask if you use photoshop, but subtle is a keyword in such a process though. I would also taken a step back to include the entire chair, giving more room on either side of the photo, but I guess the action forced you to fire :) A 7 from me</td>', 'The story here is very good, the retouching ruins it for my part. I would''ve gone for a cleaner black and white, and added more drama with darkening the sky, sea, and corners. Easily done with curves and layer mask if you use photoshop, but subtle is a keyword in such a process though. I would also taken a step back to include the entire chair, giving more room on either side of the photo, but I guess the action forced you to fire :) A 7 from me', '2013-11-13 05:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129070, 1091538, 100773, '<td valign="top">The colors in the sky is very good, but the rest looks overly done.</td>', 'The colors in the sky is very good, but the rest looks overly done.', '2013-11-13 06:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129071, 1091857, 100773, '<td valign="top">Overall very balanced shot, in every way. The wow is not here tho, so it''s a 9 from me</td>', 'Overall very balanced shot, in every way. The wow is not here tho, so it''s a 9 from me', '2013-11-13 06:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129073, 1090758, 100773, '<td valign="top">I kinda like it, decent executed from a difficult scenery with the sun blasting in like that. 6</td>', 'I kinda like it, decent executed from a difficult scenery with the sun blasting in like that. 6', '2013-11-13 06:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129075, 1091778, 100773, '<td valign="top">This is a bit flat in terms of color and contrast. I also think the white balance is a bit off. It looks chilly, but I think this could benefit from a warmer look. No harm in using cloudy white balance even tho it''s not cloudy. 6</td>', 'This is a bit flat in terms of color and contrast. I also think the white balance is a bit off. It looks chilly, but I think this could benefit from a warmer look. No harm in using cloudy white balance even tho it''s not cloudy. 6', '2013-11-13 06:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129076, 1091788, 100773, '<td valign="top">It lacks a little bit wow, but overall a very good submission to this challenge. 9</td>', 'It lacks a little bit wow, but overall a very good submission to this challenge. 9', '2013-11-13 06:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129079, 1091291, 100773, '<td valign="top">No one can say this is not a nice photo, but it doesn''t appeal to me in any way, The composition also looks a bit compromised which harms the lake a little bit. But I''m not from there so I don''t know how you could''ve improved it. 8</td>', 'No one can say this is not a nice photo, but it doesn''t appeal to me in any way, The composition also looks a bit compromised which harms the lake a little bit. But I''m not from there so I don''t know how you could''ve improved it. 8', '2013-11-13 06:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129081, 1090905, 100773, '<td valign="top">This has an hdr look on it that looks overly done. The sky whirls to much for mye taste. 5</td>', 'This has an hdr look on it that looks overly done. The sky whirls to much for mye taste. 5', '2013-11-13 06:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129086, 1091700, 100773, '<td valign="top">The composition is very pleasant, and you get the senseation of wanting to be there. Had the sky been darker and the mountain more "refined" in the post process it woulde''ve matched the color and quality of the water, and that would''ve been a 10. This is more an 8 to me. <br/> <br/>I would''ve darkened the sky with curves and then used the blue curves channel and tweaked it to match the water. Then I would use two seperate curves channels on the mountain. One of them in screen blending mode, the other  multiply. Invert the mask and brush with 5 - 10 % opacity brush where you want to enhance high lights (that screen) and shadows (multiply). The mountain should also be green, and this is more chilled, therefore not giving a good seperation between sky and water. Another curves layer where you play with the green channel would certainly green it up. When you use color channels on curves you might have to compensate with the other two channels. Often red and green go the same way, but the blue the opposite.</td>', 'The composition is very pleasant, and you get the senseation of wanting to be there. Had the sky been darker and the mountain more "refined" in the post process it woulde''ve matched the color and quality of the water, and that would''ve been a 10. This is more an 8 to me.  I would''ve darkened the sky with curves and then used the blue curves channel and tweaked it to match the water. Then I would use two seperate curves channels on the mountain. One of them in screen blending mode, the other  multiply. Invert the mask and brush with 5 - 10 % opacity brush where you want to enhance high lights (that screen) and shadows (multiply). The mountain should also be green, and this is more chilled, therefore not giving a good seperation between sky and water. Another curves layer where you play with the green channel would certainly green it up. When you use color channels on curves you might have to compensate with the other two channels. Often red and green go the same way, but the blue the opposite.', '2013-11-13 06:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129087, 1091750, 100773, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the color looks a bit artificial, which is ironic because sometimes mother nature gives us beautifull light like this that looks artificial. A minor color tweek would punch it more in the right direction. 8</td>', 'Very nice, the color looks a bit artificial, which is ironic because sometimes mother nature gives us beautifull light like this that looks artificial. A minor color tweek would punch it more in the right direction. 8', '2013-11-13 06:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129089, 1091813, 100773, '<td valign="top">Decent black and white, I would''ve darkened the grassy areas and fintuned the water so it would stand out more. This blends in to much. 6</td>', 'Decent black and white, I would''ve darkened the grassy areas and fintuned the water so it would stand out more. This blends in to much. 6', '2013-11-13 06:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129091, 1090984, 100773, '<td valign="top">Very good, no question about it. 9.</td>', 'Very good, no question about it. 9.', '2013-11-13 06:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129092, 1090704, 100773, '<td valign="top">The "mountain" in center is back lit, so I would''ve tried to darken that entire section, then darkened its shadows even more. The rest of the photo is splendid. 7</td>', 'The "mountain" in center is back lit, so I would''ve tried to darken that entire section, then darkened its shadows even more. The rest of the photo is splendid. 7', '2013-11-13 06:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129093, 1091762, 100773, '<td valign="top">This has an abstract painted quality to it that I personally love. The composition is a bit weird to me, to many randomly cropped circles, but the colors are very good. 9</td>', 'This has an abstract painted quality to it that I personally love. The composition is a bit weird to me, to many randomly cropped circles, but the colors are very good. 9', '2013-11-13 06:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129094, 1091120, 100773, '<td valign="top">Obviously very nice, I have a similar shot, but when photo and water comes together we have to drag the shutter right? The corners could darker. In photoshop you could try a lassoo and make a more natural vignette. Select what you would want to be the center of attention, in this case I would choose the leafs and where the water impacts on whatever it hits, then draw a "spikey circle" around it (imagine a star with way to many arms). Then feather it somewhere between 180 and 255 depending on how graded you want you vignette to be. Now you have a smoother "circle". Open a curves layer, invert its mask and darken your curves layer. Now you should have a very natural looking vignette. <br/> <br/>9 from me</td>', 'Obviously very nice, I have a similar shot, but when photo and water comes together we have to drag the shutter right? The corners could darker. In photoshop you could try a lassoo and make a more natural vignette. Select what you would want to be the center of attention, in this case I would choose the leafs and where the water impacts on whatever it hits, then draw a "spikey circle" around it (imagine a star with way to many arms). Then feather it somewhere between 180 and 255 depending on how graded you want you vignette to be. Now you have a smoother "circle". Open a curves layer, invert its mask and darken your curves layer. Now you should have a very natural looking vignette.  9 from me', '2013-11-13 06:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129095, 1091646, 100773, '<td valign="top">The colors to me is a bit halfway there. I would''ve used a warmer tone as a contrast to the "chilly" purple light mother nature gives. But that''s me. 6</td>', 'The colors to me is a bit halfway there. I would''ve used a warmer tone as a contrast to the "chilly" purple light mother nature gives. But that''s me. 6', '2013-11-13 06:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129096, 1091812, 100773, '<td valign="top">My first 10 so far, and I have my suspicion to who this is. Maybe the sky could be more blue and/or darker, but this has the feel of someone that knows what he/she is doing. So 10 from me</td>', 'My first 10 so far, and I have my suspicion to who this is. Maybe the sky could be more blue and/or darker, but this has the feel of someone that knows what he/she is doing. So 10 from me', '2013-11-13 06:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129097, 1091716, 100773, '<td valign="top">Overly dramatic, which suits the sky. The wave in front don''t need that much drama, and pier don''t need that much punch. 7</td>', 'Overly dramatic, which suits the sky. The wave in front don''t need that much drama, and pier don''t need that much punch. 7', '2013-11-13 06:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129099, 1090702, 100773, '<td valign="top">That kind of street light is difficult to tame in digital photography, they are to red. The rest of the photo is perfect. Beautifull water, beach and sky. Like that grainy sense I get from the sky. 7, because the lights are to dominant.</td>', 'That kind of street light is difficult to tame in digital photography, they are to red. The rest of the photo is perfect. Beautifull water, beach and sky. Like that grainy sense I get from the sky. 7, because the lights are to dominant.', '2013-11-13 06:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129100, 1091858, 100773, '<td valign="top">My second 10 of the day. Natural drama, perfectly executed in every way. 10</td>', 'My second 10 of the day. Natural drama, perfectly executed in every way. 10', '2013-11-13 06:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129101, 1091496, 100773, '<td valign="top">I think this is way to brigth, but it kinda suits it, except from the background that should be at least one stop darker. 6</td>', 'I think this is way to brigth, but it kinda suits it, except from the background that should be at least one stop darker. 6', '2013-11-13 06:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129102, 1091806, 100773, '<td valign="top">Great moment, but it looks way to much like a snap shot to put in the photo album. A very well executed snap shot though :) 6</td>', 'Great moment, but it looks way to much like a snap shot to put in the photo album. A very well executed snap shot though :) 6', '2013-11-13 06:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129103, 1091828, 100773, '<td valign="top">Brave abstraction. Bit funky colors, but I guess that only enhances the abstraction. 8</td>', 'Brave abstraction. Bit funky colors, but I guess that only enhances the abstraction. 8', '2013-11-13 06:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129104, 1091479, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented.  I thought about going there, but just didn''t have the time. Well done.</td>', 'Nicely presented.  I thought about going there, but just didn''t have the time. Well done.', '2013-11-13 06:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129105, 1091643, 100773, '<td valign="top">Had the sky been darker it would''ve matched the water, then the title would be perfect balance and a 10. 9 from me</td>', 'Had the sky been darker it would''ve matched the water, then the title would be perfect balance and a 10. 9 from me', '2013-11-13 06:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129106, 1090931, 100773, '<td valign="top">Way to overprocessed. 3</td>', 'Way to overprocessed. 3', '2013-11-13 06:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129107, 1091664, 100773, '<td valign="top">This is a 5 because of the color. the shiny trees takes to much attention a bad way for me. They should''ve been darker, if possible. These kinds of shots are a killer to retouch tho, so don''t let me break you down. At school we had a color correction master as a guest teacher once, and he would spend up to 4 days color correction his photos. Not 4 days straight, but he would check in every other day to see if he still agreed with his corrections. Check him out, his name is Joakim Eskildsen.</td>', 'This is a 5 because of the color. the shiny trees takes to much attention a bad way for me. They should''ve been darker, if possible. These kinds of shots are a killer to retouch tho, so don''t let me break you down. At school we had a color correction master as a guest teacher once, and he would spend up to 4 days color correction his photos. Not 4 days straight, but he would check in every other day to see if he still agreed with his corrections. Check him out, his name is Joakim Eskildsen.', '2013-11-13 06:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129108, 1091504, 100773, '<td valign="top">Good effort, like what you''re trying to do here, but it doesn''t work for me personally in this shot. 7</td>', 'Good effort, like what you''re trying to do here, but it doesn''t work for me personally in this shot. 7', '2013-11-13 06:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129109, 1091575, 100773, '<td valign="top">A full worthy PUBLISHED photograph would have more punch in it, which this lacks, but that doesn''t meen this is not a full worthy photograph. I would go in and brightened the high lights and darkened the shadows where possible to add more punch. 9</td>', 'A full worthy PUBLISHED photograph would have more punch in it, which this lacks, but that doesn''t meen this is not a full worthy photograph. I would go in and brightened the high lights and darkened the shadows where possible to add more punch. 9', '2013-11-13 06:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129110, 1091701, 100773, '<td valign="top">The color and composition is very good, and I can see this being published as a photo to build up the better ones in a series. It''s a bit boring as a "stand alone photograph" because it''s to much of a documentation of what nature has done here, but I guess that is well within the challenge description. 8</td>', 'The color and composition is very good, and I can see this being published as a photo to build up the better ones in a series. It''s a bit boring as a "stand alone photograph" because it''s to much of a documentation of what nature has done here, but I guess that is well within the challenge description. 8', '2013-11-13 06:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129111, 1091507, 100773, '<td valign="top">This has a false vibe to it with the colors and the swans. Very unpleasant, in a good way. 7</td>', 'This has a false vibe to it with the colors and the swans. Very unpleasant, in a good way. 7', '2013-11-13 06:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129112, 1091663, 100773, '<td valign="top">I don''t like clouds that looks like they''re moving much. They should be 100% blurred by the shutter or standing still. But that''s me! Apart from that I like this. 7</td>', 'I don''t like clouds that looks like they''re moving much. They should be 100% blurred by the shutter or standing still. But that''s me! Apart from that I like this. 7', '2013-11-13 06:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129114, 1091767, 100773, '<td valign="top">I would try to drag the shutter even more to create more blur, but that''s playing it safe. I like what you have done here. 9</td>', 'I would try to drag the shutter even more to create more blur, but that''s playing it safe. I like what you have done here. 9', '2013-11-13 06:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129117, 1091798, 100773, '<td valign="top">Even though it''s red against green and blue it doesn''t stand out properly. I would''ve changed up this scene and gone for the reflections in the pond and left everything else. 5</td>', 'Even though it''s red against green and blue it doesn''t stand out properly. I would''ve changed up this scene and gone for the reflections in the pond and left everything else. 5', '2013-11-13 06:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129118, 1091592, 100773, '<td valign="top">"between here and there is a good score from me" 9</td>', '"between here and there is a good score from me" 9', '2013-11-13 06:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129119, 1091786, 100773, '<td valign="top">Abstractions on dpc usually doesn''t fare well, and there''s another one that outshines this one in this contest, so this gets a bit boring. The beauty of abstractions are that there are noe limits; it''s a dream world. This would look nice on any wall, but it lacks intensity and mystery for me. 5</td>', 'Abstractions on dpc usually doesn''t fare well, and there''s another one that outshines this one in this contest, so this gets a bit boring. The beauty of abstractions are that there are noe limits; it''s a dream world. This would look nice on any wall, but it lacks intensity and mystery for me. 5', '2013-11-13 07:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129120, 1091776, 100773, '<td valign="top">Even though this might be the color mother nature gave you, it comes across as a bit unreel, mainly becauste it''s a bit flat. Darken dark areas and lighten light areas would create more pop and a more realistic look I think. 6</td>', 'Even though this might be the color mother nature gave you, it comes across as a bit unreel, mainly becauste it''s a bit flat. Darken dark areas and lighten light areas would create more pop and a more realistic look I think. 6', '2013-11-13 07:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129122, 1090953, 100773, '<td valign="top">Very intens photo. 9 because of that hugh bright area where the sun is. Don''t think you could''ve done anything differently, but it ruins it a bit.</td>', 'Very intens photo. 9 because of that hugh bright area where the sun is. Don''t think you could''ve done anything differently, but it ruins it a bit.', '2013-11-13 07:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129123, 1091548, 100773, '<td valign="top">Very controlled and well executed. 9</td>', 'Very controlled and well executed. 9', '2013-11-13 07:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129125, 1091661, 100773, '<td valign="top">Good feel, good grain, not so good colors, perfect moment. 7</td>', 'Good feel, good grain, not so good colors, perfect moment. 7', '2013-11-13 07:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129127, 1091781, 100773, '<td valign="top">The water is perfect, but everything else is to light. 6</td>', 'The water is perfect, but everything else is to light. 6', '2013-11-13 07:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129129, 1091854, 100773, '<td valign="top">Candid/street photography is a very respectfull art of photography. Shooting someones back is not respectfull, and 98% of the time it''s boring. I was thinking about a simiar approach, so I get what you are trying to do here, but the photo is not good enough for that. 1, sorry</td>', 'Candid/street photography is a very respectfull art of photography. Shooting someones back is not respectfull, and 98% of the time it''s boring. I was thinking about a simiar approach, so I get what you are trying to do here, but the photo is not good enough for that. 1, sorry', '2013-11-13 07:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129131, 1091674, 100773, '<td valign="top">Harmonious and mystic. A few tweeks here and there could maybe enhance this, but it''s very beautifull as is. 9</td>', 'Harmonious and mystic. A few tweeks here and there could maybe enhance this, but it''s very beautifull as is. 9', '2013-11-13 07:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
