(7129171, 1091626, 100773, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure, but I think I would''ve tried to tone down the redness on the shore. The redness is very nice, and I guess that was the light anyway, but it feels somewhat unatural to me. That being said, this is a clear 10 and I''ll be rooting for you to ribbon on this.</td>', 'I''m not sure, but I think I would''ve tried to tone down the redness on the shore. The redness is very nice, and I guess that was the light anyway, but it feels somewhat unatural to me. That being said, this is a clear 10 and I''ll be rooting for you to ribbon on this.', '2013-11-13 09:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129172, 1091794, 100773, '<td valign="top">The foreground is a bit light and draws to much attention, but apart from that this is a stunning photograph. 8, had been a clear 10 if the foreground harmonized better with the rest of the photo.</td>', 'The foreground is a bit light and draws to much attention, but apart from that this is a stunning photograph. 8, had been a clear 10 if the foreground harmonized better with the rest of the photo.', '2013-11-13 09:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129173, 1091744, 100773, '<td valign="top">This has a very strait out of camera look, which is something one should strive for at times, but in this case it looks a bit to flat. A few tweaks here and there would lift this photo alot. 6</td>', 'This has a very strait out of camera look, which is something one should strive for at times, but in this case it looks a bit to flat. A few tweaks here and there would lift this photo alot. 6', '2013-11-13 09:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129174, 1091292, 100773, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you are at full zoom on your camera or lens to capture this. Personally I would avoid zooming like that. One way of using tele is to get close when you can not physically move there, so if you can''t get close enough you usually get things like this where you are not particularly drawn into the action.</td>', 'I''m guessing you are at full zoom on your camera or lens to capture this. Personally I would avoid zooming like that. One way of using tele is to get close when you can not physically move there, so if you can''t get close enough you usually get things like this where you are not particularly drawn into the action.', '2013-11-13 09:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129176, 1091573, 100773, '<td valign="top">The background is somewhat disturbing, so I think I would''ve included more of it, or exclude it completely. Apart from that this is a clear 10, but I give 9 because of the background.</td>', 'The background is somewhat disturbing, so I think I would''ve included more of it, or exclude it completely. Apart from that this is a clear 10, but I give 9 because of the background.', '2013-11-13 09:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129177, 1091852, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit grey for a black and white, which can be helped by more contrast. Apart from that it''s good. 6</td>', 'It''s a bit grey for a black and white, which can be helped by more contrast. Apart from that it''s good. 6', '2013-11-13 09:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129179, 1091651, 100773, '<td valign="top">I find this a very humble submission that deserves to be rewarded with a 10 for its simplicity. It''s color doesn''t pop, but it doesn''t need it. The contrast is a bit flat, but it''s gorgeous the way it is. Could maybe be a bit darker at the top half of your photo to give an illusion of depth</td>', 'I find this a very humble submission that deserves to be rewarded with a 10 for its simplicity. It''s color doesn''t pop, but it doesn''t need it. The contrast is a bit flat, but it''s gorgeous the way it is. Could maybe be a bit darker at the top half of your photo to give an illusion of depth', '2013-11-13 09:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129181, 1091838, 100773, '<td valign="top">The waterfall looks very hard, not soothing and perfect as the rest of your shot does. A faster shutter could help that I think. 9</td>', 'The waterfall looks very hard, not soothing and perfect as the rest of your shot does. A faster shutter could help that I think. 9', '2013-11-13 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129182, 1091785, 100773, '<td valign="top">It looks a bit desaturated, which I don''t like in this photo, but that''s me. A nice composition and scene! 7</td>', 'It looks a bit desaturated, which I don''t like in this photo, but that''s me. A nice composition and scene! 7', '2013-11-13 09:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129184, 1091747, 100773, '<td valign="top">The water doesn''t look nice in this. It looks like it has been oversharpened due to the way the waves are. A slower shutter would drag them to create subtle movement, but I understand that was difficult with such strong sunlight. Good black and whit, nice and contrasty. 7</td>', 'The water doesn''t look nice in this. It looks like it has been oversharpened due to the way the waves are. A slower shutter would drag them to create subtle movement, but I understand that was difficult with such strong sunlight. Good black and whit, nice and contrasty. 7', '2013-11-13 09:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129185, 1091511, 100773, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice feel, subtle and harmonious. 8</td>', 'Nice colors, nice feel, subtle and harmonious. 8', '2013-11-13 09:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129187, 1091721, 100773, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the green border, ruins it for me. Apart from that this is a perfect submission. 8 because of the border</td>', 'I don''t like the green border, ruins it for me. Apart from that this is a perfect submission. 8 because of the border', '2013-11-13 09:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129188, 1091824, 100773, '<td valign="top">I think the top black line is disturbing, but that might be a personal preference. Apart from that it''s a great abstraction. 9</td>', 'I think the top black line is disturbing, but that might be a personal preference. Apart from that it''s a great abstraction. 9', '2013-11-13 09:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129190, 1091333, 100773, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. Not much more to say. 8</td>', 'I like this alot. Not much more to say. 8', '2013-11-13 09:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129207, 1091061, 60173, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, nothing is in focus here. Also, there''s large patches of white that are over-exposed. The upper right corner of the shot has some interesting richness going on in it that I like.</td>', 'Unfortunately, nothing is in focus here. Also, there''s large patches of white that are over-exposed. The upper right corner of the shot has some interesting richness going on in it that I like.', '2013-11-13 11:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129210, 1090885, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is nice. The flawed bit of dock makes this image unique.</td>', 'This is nice. The flawed bit of dock makes this image unique.', '2013-11-13 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129211, 1091757, 60173, '<td valign="top">I see a teensy bit of motion blur, but otherwise, nice shot.</td>', 'I see a teensy bit of motion blur, but otherwise, nice shot.', '2013-11-13 11:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129213, 1091612, 60173, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling you''re going to get hammered in this challenge for photographing a fountain, as it is not natural.<br/> <br/>The exposure is nice, and in general I like the composition. What I don''t like about the composition is the background elements such as the cars and light post. Also, in Advanced Editing challenges, you can remove those power lines.</td>', 'I have a feeling you''re going to get hammered in this challenge for photographing a fountain, as it is not natural. The exposure is nice, and in general I like the composition. What I don''t like about the composition is the background elements such as the cars and light post. Also, in Advanced Editing challenges, you can remove those power lines.', '2013-11-13 11:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129214, 1090998, 60173, '<td valign="top">Great choice to go with a square crop on this. It really stands out in the challenge.</td>', 'Great choice to go with a square crop on this. It really stands out in the challenge.', '2013-11-13 11:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129217, 1091796, 60173, '<td valign="top">That blue is way over-saturated. Not a bad shot other than that.</td>', 'That blue is way over-saturated. Not a bad shot other than that.', '2013-11-13 11:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129220, 1091479, 60173, '<td valign="top">As someone that lives in Oregon, I''ve seen a lot of this waterfall. I''m not voting, but I have to ask myself, if I were to shoot this shot, what would I do to separate mine from the rest of the photos? This is well executed, but it doesn''t stand out from every other photo I''ve seen of this falls. <br/> <br/>I must admit, I don''t know how I would shoot this differently. I know, not a whole lot of help, sorry. In summary, nice photo, but you''re boring the locals.  :)</td>', 'As someone that lives in Oregon, I''ve seen a lot of this waterfall. I''m not voting, but I have to ask myself, if I were to shoot this shot, what would I do to separate mine from the rest of the photos? This is well executed, but it doesn''t stand out from every other photo I''ve seen of this falls.  I must admit, I don''t know how I would shoot this differently. I know, not a whole lot of help, sorry. In summary, nice photo, but you''re boring the locals.  :)', '2013-11-13 11:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129223, 1091728, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s not much separation between the sand and water contrast-wise. I know he''s standing on land, but I have to keep telling my brain that every time I look at it. My instinctual brain doesn''t believe me, which is causing me to get stuck looking at his feet rather than enjoying the photo as a whole. I think just burning the edge of the land to create a subtle dark line would help with this.</td>', 'There''s not much separation between the sand and water contrast-wise. I know he''s standing on land, but I have to keep telling my brain that every time I look at it. My instinctual brain doesn''t believe me, which is causing me to get stuck looking at his feet rather than enjoying the photo as a whole. I think just burning the edge of the land to create a subtle dark line would help with this.', '2013-11-13 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129227, 1091762, 60173, '<td valign="top">Great abstract piece. My first instinct was to flip it up-side-down. I took a screenshot and was flipping it around in Photoshop. I can''t honestly say that I like any of the other orientations better. I can easily see this photo, in any orientation, on a wall somewhere.</td>', 'Great abstract piece. My first instinct was to flip it up-side-down. I took a screenshot and was flipping it around in Photoshop. I can''t honestly say that I like any of the other orientations better. I can easily see this photo, in any orientation, on a wall somewhere.', '2013-11-13 11:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129250, 1091718, 100773, '<td valign="top">The jewels look a little fake. If they''re not, I apologies. The mood of the photo is nice tho. 5</td>', 'The jewels look a little fake. If they''re not, I apologies. The mood of the photo is nice tho. 5', '2013-11-13 12:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129251, 1091755, 100773, '<td valign="top">The colors are a bit dull, but I think this is a nice photo in terms of composition and story. 7</td>', 'The colors are a bit dull, but I think this is a nice photo in terms of composition and story. 7', '2013-11-13 12:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129255, 1091821, 100773, '<td valign="top">The stones under water in the foreground is a bit distracting. The moving water with a slow shutter speed creates an illusion that the stones are moving, at least I see it that way. Apart from that this is a very nice picture where technique, composition and retouching harmonizes well with each other. 8</td>', 'The stones under water in the foreground is a bit distracting. The moving water with a slow shutter speed creates an illusion that the stones are moving, at least I see it that way. Apart from that this is a very nice picture where technique, composition and retouching harmonizes well with each other. 8', '2013-11-13 12:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129258, 1091853, 100773, '<td valign="top">A beautifull moment filled with story. I also like that you have detail in the foreground. 10</td>', 'A beautifull moment filled with story. I also like that you have detail in the foreground. 10', '2013-11-13 12:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129330, 1091744, 30982, '<td valign="top">"Untitled" or "River Scene", perhaps?  :-)  (In other words, IMG_0750 seems to indicate you put in a placeholder and forgot to go back and properly enter your image into the challenge.  Just a thought!)</td>', '"Untitled" or "River Scene", perhaps?  :-)  (In other words, IMG_0750 seems to indicate you put in a placeholder and forgot to go back and properly enter your image into the challenge.  Just a thought!)', '2013-11-13 13:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129331, 1091813, 30982, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the subtlety of the body of water you chose!</td>', 'I appreciate the subtlety of the body of water you chose!', '2013-11-13 13:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129332, 1090758, 30982, '<td valign="top">I appreciate that you chose to frame the shot using the pier, and aligned it so, but I prefer the ocean to be level, even if that means the pier is sloped (which they usually are).  I do also like how your people are incomplete suggestions - that works for me.</td>', 'I appreciate that you chose to frame the shot using the pier, and aligned it so, but I prefer the ocean to be level, even if that means the pier is sloped (which they usually are).  I do also like how your people are incomplete suggestions - that works for me.', '2013-11-13 13:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129333, 1091721, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quiet and understated.  I''d prefer it without the green border, but that''s a personal preference.</td>', 'Quiet and understated.  I''d prefer it without the green border, but that''s a personal preference.', '2013-11-13 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129334, 1091762, 61234, '<td valign="top">My favorite image of this challenge which means if will fetch the blue;)<br/>Gorgeous!</td>', 'My favorite image of this challenge which means if will fetch the blue;)Gorgeous!', '2013-11-13 13:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
