(7129336, 1091853, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light, nice flow in the composition.  I like that we can just barely see snow atop the mountains in the distance.</td>', 'Gorgeous light, nice flow in the composition.  I like that we can just barely see snow atop the mountains in the distance.', '2013-11-13 13:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129348, 1091706, 28427, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Simply stunning Marac.  The colour of the ocean gives me a real Caribbean feel.  If this one doesn''t end up high, way high then there''s something fundamentally wrong with DPC. - only commenting (with regrets because I would so much love to distribute a 10 to this entry)</td>', 'Stunning. Simply stunning Marac.  The colour of the ocean gives me a real Caribbean feel.  If this one doesn''t end up high, way high then there''s something fundamentally wrong with DPC. - only commenting (with regrets because I would so much love to distribute a 10 to this entry)', '2013-11-13 14:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129351, 1091841, 28427, '<td valign="top">So Monet-like.  From the bridge of Les Nymphéas at Rouen till the impressionistic touch and colours.  Great work.</td>', 'So Monet-like.  From the bridge of Les Nymphéas at Rouen till the impressionistic touch and colours.  Great work.', '2013-11-13 14:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129353, 1091291, 28427, '<td valign="top">I would want this view each day Kees.  It feels like any moment a knight on a horse might come into the picture.  And way back there in the back, I think I just saw Nessie :).  Should score very well. - only commenting.</td>', 'I would want this view each day Kees.  It feels like any moment a knight on a horse might come into the picture.  And way back there in the back, I think I just saw Nessie :).  Should score very well. - only commenting.', '2013-11-13 14:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7129354, 1091773, 28427, '<td valign="top">Curious how many voters will indeed understand the effort which went into this image.  If they read the title, and I mean really READ it, they should get a hint.<br/>Thank you Marcia.</td>', 'Curious how many voters will indeed understand the effort which went into this image.  If they read the title, and I mean really READ it, they should get a hint.Thank you Marcia.', '2013-11-13 14:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
