(7129520, 1091573, 114225, '<td valign="top">There is some nice action and color here, but I find myself distracted by the out of focus rocks in the foreground.</td>', 'There is some nice action and color here, but I find myself distracted by the out of focus rocks in the foreground.', '2013-11-13 16:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
