(7129522, 1091716, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice power in this shot. I wonder what it would looks like with a little more refined editing. I like the editing on the water, but the pier and sky lok a bit over done.</td>', 'Nice power in this shot. I wonder what it would looks like with a little more refined editing. I like the editing on the water, but the pier and sky lok a bit over done.', '2013-11-13 16:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
