(7131761, 1091061, 100773, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look like you used a tripod when you dragged the shutter, and the sky is blown out as well as the background is over exposed. You should''ve used a faster shutter, or come back later when it was darker if you wanted the water movement. 2 from me because it''s not a very good executed shot. Sorry</td>', 'It doesn''t look like you used a tripod when you dragged the shutter, and the sky is blown out as well as the background is over exposed. You should''ve used a faster shutter, or come back later when it was darker if you wanted the water movement. 2 from me because it''s not a very good executed shot. Sorry', '2013-11-18 15:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131762, 1090633, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s a back lit situation, which in my world calles for very contrasty black and white, or very flat. This is a bit dull for me, but nice composition and idea. 6</td>', 'It''s a back lit situation, which in my world calles for very contrasty black and white, or very flat. This is a bit dull for me, but nice composition and idea. 6', '2013-11-18 15:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
