(7131773, 1090932, 100773, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a tad bright, especially the sky and water, but otherwise a very good shot. 8</td>', 'I think it''s a tad bright, especially the sky and water, but otherwise a very good shot. 8', '2013-11-18 15:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131775, 1091080, 100773, '<td valign="top">What I hate about this photo is that it ends. It should be a megalong panorama that went on forever. 10</td>', 'What I hate about this photo is that it ends. It should be a megalong panorama that went on forever. 10', '2013-11-18 15:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131776, 1091740, 100773, '<td valign="top">The colors doesn''t look good, and it has this unpleasant color noise look where the water meets the rocks. Otherwise this capture is stunning. 6</td>', 'The colors doesn''t look good, and it has this unpleasant color noise look where the water meets the rocks. Otherwise this capture is stunning. 6', '2013-11-18 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131777, 1091836, 100773, '<td valign="top">10, nothing more to say really. I have my suspicions to who this is as well</td>', '10, nothing more to say really. I have my suspicions to who this is as well', '2013-11-18 15:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131779, 1090657, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice scene, and fairly well composed, but the colors are not as good. In situations like this where you can''t get the color right, go black and white and punch the contrast. 4</td>', 'It''s a nice scene, and fairly well composed, but the colors are not as good. In situations like this where you can''t get the color right, go black and white and punch the contrast. 4', '2013-11-18 15:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131780, 1091473, 100773, '<td valign="top">The scene is beautifull and well documented. The only thing I don''t like about this is that the sky is purple. It should''ve been blue or darker so that the purple had more of a punch. Not sure what I think of your crop either. 7</td>', 'The scene is beautifull and well documented. The only thing I don''t like about this is that the sky is purple. It should''ve been blue or darker so that the purple had more of a punch. Not sure what I think of your crop either. 7', '2013-11-18 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131782, 1090625, 100773, '<td valign="top">The ducks are in the dark portion of the photograph, and the snow takes all the attention. Had you underexposed you could tone the snow down and pulled the ducks up I think. 3</td>', 'The ducks are in the dark portion of the photograph, and the snow takes all the attention. Had you underexposed you could tone the snow down and pulled the ducks up I think. 3', '2013-11-18 15:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131783, 1091037, 100773, '<td valign="top">For me the sky could be darker, but that''s about the only thing I can put my judgemental finger on. 9</td>', 'For me the sky could be darker, but that''s about the only thing I can put my judgemental finger on. 9', '2013-11-18 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131784, 1091849, 100773, '<td valign="top">To me it''s nice and safe, but still nice. 7</td>', 'To me it''s nice and safe, but still nice. 7', '2013-11-18 15:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131785, 1090873, 100773, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is a bit to demanding of the viewer, but stunningly executed and processed. 7</td>', 'I think the composition is a bit to demanding of the viewer, but stunningly executed and processed. 7', '2013-11-18 15:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131786, 1091771, 100773, '<td valign="top">I would like more contrast. 8</td>', 'I would like more contrast. 8', '2013-11-18 15:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131788, 1091612, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s man made, which tweaks the regulation a bit. But that''s allowed. I don''t like the composition, we should see where the fountain emerges from the water as they do in the back. The colors and how you have used the light is not to my liking either, so sorry, 2 from me</td>', 'It''s man made, which tweaks the regulation a bit. But that''s allowed. I don''t like the composition, we should see where the fountain emerges from the water as they do in the back. The colors and how you have used the light is not to my liking either, so sorry, 2 from me', '2013-11-18 15:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131789, 1091706, 100773, '<td valign="top">No reason why I shouldn''t give this a 10 unless you think of one. 10</td>', 'No reason why I shouldn''t give this a 10 unless you think of one. 10', '2013-11-18 15:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131791, 1091730, 100773, '<td valign="top">Had it been underexposed by 2/3 of a stop the colors, even the dead dull ones on the leaves, had popped more and the sky had been more dramatic. But apart from that it''s a great scene and all. 7</td>', 'Had it been underexposed by 2/3 of a stop the colors, even the dead dull ones on the leaves, had popped more and the sky had been more dramatic. But apart from that it''s a great scene and all. 7', '2013-11-18 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131792, 1091827, 100773, '<td valign="top">The center is bright, which I like, so I think it''s surroundings could be a bit darker. Like the shot, 7</td>', 'The center is bright, which I like, so I think it''s surroundings could be a bit darker. Like the shot, 7', '2013-11-18 15:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131793, 1091632, 100773, '<td valign="top">I give you creds for putting yourself and the camera out there, well done. It''s also very good, but I think I would tried to underexpose it a bit because of the background, or done two shots where you just mask in a slightly darker background. Maybe. 8</td>', 'I give you creds for putting yourself and the camera out there, well done. It''s also very good, but I think I would tried to underexpose it a bit because of the background, or done two shots where you just mask in a slightly darker background. Maybe. 8', '2013-11-18 15:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131795, 1091753, 100773, '<td valign="top">I can hardly see the pond, so that''s not good. You could darkened everything that is not pond to accentuate your little pond. 2</td>', 'I can hardly see the pond, so that''s not good. You could darkened everything that is not pond to accentuate your little pond. 2', '2013-11-18 15:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131796, 1091500, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s bit expected, isn''t it, but 10 from me because it''s well executed, which is not as expected.</td>', 'It''s bit expected, isn''t it, but 10 from me because it''s well executed, which is not as expected.', '2013-11-18 15:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131799, 1091648, 100773, '<td valign="top">I think the black and white lacks fine touch. The sky is very dramatic, and the boats very bright. A good photo nevertheless. 7</td>', 'I think the black and white lacks fine touch. The sky is very dramatic, and the boats very bright. A good photo nevertheless. 7', '2013-11-18 15:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131800, 1091479, 100773, '<td valign="top">Good colors and execution. I''m struggling a bit with the brightness of the mountainside, but that''s nitpicking. 7</td>', 'Good colors and execution. I''m struggling a bit with the brightness of the mountainside, but that''s nitpicking. 7', '2013-11-18 16:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131801, 1091594, 100773, '<td valign="top">Do you mean the sun as a sympathetic reflection? I would''ve angled the camera differently to avoud it because the rest of the scene is daring, beautiful and breathtaking. 7</td>', 'Do you mean the sun as a sympathetic reflection? I would''ve angled the camera differently to avoud it because the rest of the scene is daring, beautiful and breathtaking. 7', '2013-11-18 16:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131802, 1090998, 100773, '<td valign="top">Due to the title I would like to see a swimmer. Nice shot though. 6</td>', 'Due to the title I would like to see a swimmer. Nice shot though. 6', '2013-11-18 16:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131803, 1091332, 100773, '<td valign="top">I like the look. Reminds me of instagram which I''m very into at the moment, so it appeals well. The reason I say so is the burned out sky and overexposed background way back there, but that makes it cute. 6</td>', 'I like the look. Reminds me of instagram which I''m very into at the moment, so it appeals well. The reason I say so is the burned out sky and overexposed background way back there, but that makes it cute. 6', '2013-11-18 16:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131804, 1091711, 100773, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing to put my finger on here besides personal preferences, but this is you capturing this beautifull scene not me :) 8</td>', 'There''s nothing to put my finger on here besides personal preferences, but this is you capturing this beautifull scene not me :) 8', '2013-11-18 16:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131805, 1091597, 100773, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing to put my finger on here besides personal preferences, but this is you capturing this beautifull scene not me :) 8</td>', 'There''s nothing to put my finger on here besides personal preferences, but this is you capturing this beautifull scene not me :) 8', '2013-11-18 16:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131806, 1091596, 100773, '<td valign="top">I like it, 7</td>', 'I like it, 7', '2013-11-18 16:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131807, 1091846, 100773, '<td valign="top">The look of this photograph is way to overdone for me. 5</td>', 'The look of this photograph is way to overdone for me. 5', '2013-11-18 16:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131808, 1091815, 100773, '<td valign="top">The colors are strange to me, but it does have a nice snapshot feel to it. 5</td>', 'The colors are strange to me, but it does have a nice snapshot feel to it. 5', '2013-11-18 16:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131809, 1091127, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s a pleasant capture. 6</td>', 'It''s a pleasant capture. 6', '2013-11-18 16:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131810, 1091528, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice entry, but it doesn''t stand out as a few other city shots do. 5</td>', 'It''s a nice entry, but it doesn''t stand out as a few other city shots do. 5', '2013-11-18 16:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131811, 1091845, 100773, '<td valign="top">The water is nice, but everything else is to bright. Had the orange been darker the colors would be better, and that goes for the sky to. 6</td>', 'The water is nice, but everything else is to bright. Had the orange been darker the colors would be better, and that goes for the sky to. 6', '2013-11-18 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131812, 1091712, 100773, '<td valign="top">Cute entry, but not as exciting as many others. 4</td>', 'Cute entry, but not as exciting as many others. 4', '2013-11-18 16:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131813, 1091682, 100773, '<td valign="top">Cute entry, bit lacks a bit of excitement as many others do. 6</td>', 'Cute entry, bit lacks a bit of excitement as many others do. 6', '2013-11-18 16:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131838, 1091846, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but WAY over-processed.</td>', 'Nice scene, but WAY over-processed.', '2013-11-18 18:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131839, 1090998, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great time of day and wonderful color.  Had you straightened the horizon it would be worth 2 more points (kind of a basic thing for a scene like this).</td>', 'Great time of day and wonderful color.  Had you straightened the horizon it would be worth 2 more points (kind of a basic thing for a scene like this).', '2013-11-18 18:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131840, 1091740, 30049, '<td valign="top">What color is that sky?</td>', 'What color is that sky?', '2013-11-18 18:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131888, 1090945, 50695, '<td valign="top">Cool processing.</td>', 'Cool processing.', '2013-11-18 22:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131894, 1091522, 170018, '<td valign="top">There are two photos in this challenge that I''m giving ten and the feature for both of them is fog. What is it so appealing in it? Combination of tree fuzziness with smooth silk water, muted colors with splashes of orange and red coming through? I don''t know, but I love it! Thank you!</td>', 'There are two photos in this challenge that I''m giving ten and the feature for both of them is fog. What is it so appealing in it? Combination of tree fuzziness with smooth silk water, muted colors with splashes of orange and red coming through? I don''t know, but I love it! Thank you!', '2013-11-18 23:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131897, 1091037, 170018, '<td valign="top">I love your treatment of the photo! Hope you can describe what you did! Those bright red and orange stand out of smooth brown and green so beautifully. Water and sky are perfectly finishing the composition.<br/>...I''m staring at your image already for 5 minutes...This brown tree on the right is great too.</td>', 'I love your treatment of the photo! Hope you can describe what you did! Those bright red and orange stand out of smooth brown and green so beautifully. Water and sky are perfectly finishing the composition....I''m staring at your image already for 5 minutes...This brown tree on the right is great too.', '2013-11-18 23:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131898, 1091648, 170018, '<td valign="top">wish I can see the colors...</td>', 'wish I can see the colors...', '2013-11-18 23:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131899, 1091646, 170018, '<td valign="top">wish it''s not as busy...</td>', 'wish it''s not as busy...', '2013-11-18 23:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131900, 1090932, 170018, '<td valign="top">The trees are so light and airy that I almost wish you had not included the bright foreground leaves... It''s still very beautiful! 8</td>', 'The trees are so light and airy that I almost wish you had not included the bright foreground leaves... It''s still very beautiful! 8', '2013-11-18 23:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131901, 1091781, 170018, '<td valign="top">Is it snow or HDR? Or both? It''s such an interesting effect! Beautiful cascades, just smoothed enough and nice combination of blue water and orange leaves.</td>', 'Is it snow or HDR? Or both? It''s such an interesting effect! Beautiful cascades, just smoothed enough and nice combination of blue water and orange leaves.', '2013-11-18 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131902, 1091504, 170018, '<td valign="top">I am admiring people who can capture the sunrise!</td>', 'I am admiring people who can capture the sunrise!', '2013-11-18 23:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131910, 1091858, 170018, '<td valign="top">This is one moody image! Love those reeds and forest, which looks like it''s from Russian scary fairy-tale. :-) Seriously, there''s Baba Yaga (scary-looking, kids-eating analogue of witch) peeking out from behind a tree!<br/>Wish the birds are positioned differently though.</td>', 'This is one moody image! Love those reeds and forest, which looks like it''s from Russian scary fairy-tale. :-) Seriously, there''s Baba Yaga (scary-looking, kids-eating analogue of witch) peeking out from behind a tree!Wish the birds are positioned differently though.', '2013-11-19 00:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131915, 1091194, 114285, '<td valign="top">Sensational feel to this, a winner for me, it really draws me in!</td>', 'Sensational feel to this, a winner for me, it really draws me in!', '2013-11-19 01:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131916, 1091080, 114285, '<td valign="top">ha, this looks like my last entry!</td>', 'ha, this looks like my last entry!', '2013-11-19 01:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131917, 1091496, 114285, '<td valign="top">this would make an awesome print, the lovely abstract reflections in the lake really make this, and not to mention the awesome PP, well done.</td>', 'this would make an awesome print, the lovely abstract reflections in the lake really make this, and not to mention the awesome PP, well done.', '2013-11-19 01:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131919, 1091536, 114285, '<td valign="top">absolutely stunning, and my pick for a ribbon, the fallen leaves is what makes this and the awesome abstract and painternly feel to this, it''s very verineat <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1070026" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1070026.jpg"/></a></td>', 'absolutely stunning, and my pick for a ribbon, the fallen leaves is what makes this and the awesome abstract and painternly feel to this, it''s very verineat ', '2013-11-19 01:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131920, 1091718, 114285, '<td valign="top">sweet!</td>', 'sweet!', '2013-11-19 01:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131921, 1091719, 114285, '<td valign="top">unusual, I like it!</td>', 'unusual, I like it!', '2013-11-19 01:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131922, 1091626, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy feel to this, and not to mention the colors.</td>', 'Very dreamy feel to this, and not to mention the colors.', '2013-11-19 01:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
