(7132413, 1091854, 114233, '<td valign="top">Very natural body of water Harvey but I''m sure you were expecting it to get hammered. Brave man LOL</td>', 'Very natural body of water Harvey but I''m sure you were expecting it to get hammered. Brave man LOL', '2013-11-20 01:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
