(7132417, 1091643, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lovely coulours and reflection, so peaceful. Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Lovely coulours and reflection, so peaceful. Congrats on the HM!', '2013-11-20 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132426, 1091479, 123833, '<td valign="top">Congrats on HM, Highfiver! :)</td>', 'Congrats on HM, Highfiver! :)', '2013-11-20 02:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132429, 1091080, 93565, '<td valign="top">If this were blurred a TINY BIT more, I would call it Ursula-esque. Very nice, love the serenity.</td>', 'If this were blurred a TINY BIT more, I would call it Ursula-esque. Very nice, love the serenity.', '2013-11-20 02:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132430, 1091762, 93565, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote, but I find this horribly underrated. I really love the lily pads and the reflected tree trunks.</td>', 'I didn''t vote, but I find this horribly underrated. I really love the lily pads and the reflected tree trunks.', '2013-11-20 02:29:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132434, 1091536, 93565, '<td valign="top">Not what I would normally expect of you, but a very nicely romanticized shot. I enjoy the colors of the leaves, but the depth of the photo really brings things together. So much to really see here- I appreciate the focus throughout. Would''ve figured this for higher to the top, frankly.</td>', 'Not what I would normally expect of you, but a very nicely romanticized shot. I enjoy the colors of the leaves, but the depth of the photo really brings things together. So much to really see here- I appreciate the focus throughout. Would''ve figured this for higher to the top, frankly.', '2013-11-20 02:32:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132436, 1091548, 93565, '<td valign="top">You and your brooding compositions! (meant positively :) )<br/>I''d almost suggest you crop down more fully to the waterway, illustrating the excellent texture of the water more fully. This is a great shot, but the city distracts noticeably from the water itself for this prompt.</td>', 'You and your brooding compositions! (meant positively :) )I''d almost suggest you crop down more fully to the waterway, illustrating the excellent texture of the water more fully. This is a great shot, but the city distracts noticeably from the water itself for this prompt.', '2013-11-20 02:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132440, 1091812, 93565, '<td valign="top">The birds add a really nice reality to this scene which can tend to be left behind in perfected shots of landscapes. I like them there.</td>', 'The birds add a really nice reality to this scene which can tend to be left behind in perfected shots of landscapes. I like them there.', '2013-11-20 02:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132441, 1091858, 93565, '<td valign="top">Your ability to make what is oft called "dead" or "bland" foliage work well here is worthy of mention. Quite pleased to see somebody with a nice photo that isn''t gorgeous green or pleasing sunset.</td>', 'Your ability to make what is oft called "dead" or "bland" foliage work well here is worthy of mention. Quite pleased to see somebody with a nice photo that isn''t gorgeous green or pleasing sunset.', '2013-11-20 02:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132447, 1090953, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect candidate for HDR. Your setting sun has quite obviously overwhelmed your sensor, so doing a combination of exposures to maintain  that would be perfect here.</td>', 'This is a perfect candidate for HDR. Your setting sun has quite obviously overwhelmed your sensor, so doing a combination of exposures to maintain  that would be perfect here.', '2013-11-20 02:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132449, 1091829, 93565, '<td valign="top">Really like the rays and the huge contrast between land and water. You''ve got a bit of sensor dust top right. I''m looking more for this myself, as my camera suddenly became horribly dirty very quickly as of late.<br/> <br/>ETA: Not big on the border, but I''m generally negative on borders here, so hard to say.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-11-20 02:59:26.</i></td>', 'Really like the rays and the huge contrast between land and water. You''ve got a bit of sensor dust top right. I''m looking more for this myself, as my camera suddenly became horribly dirty very quickly as of late. ETA: Not big on the border, but I''m generally negative on borders here, so hard to say.', '2013-11-20 02:58:31.000000', '2013-11-20 02:59:26.000000', 0),
(7132450, 1091706, 52549, '<td valign="top">Delighted that this beauty did so well for you. Excellent work, MAK. Congrats.</td>', 'Delighted that this beauty did so well for you. Excellent work, MAK. Congrats.', '2013-11-20 02:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132451, 1090905, 93565, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this would''ve done better in Negative Space.<br/> <br/>I think the "over pushed" HDR-ness of the sky is really due to the shutter duration, and separate from processing. Love the scene, but feel the downplayed water and notable sky would''ve been a good candidate for challenges other than body of water, which is minimized here.</td>', 'I have a feeling this would''ve done better in Negative Space. I think the "over pushed" HDR-ness of the sky is really due to the shutter duration, and separate from processing. Love the scene, but feel the downplayed water and notable sky would''ve been a good candidate for challenges other than body of water, which is minimized here.', '2013-11-20 03:02:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132452, 1091626, 52549, '<td valign="top">Amazing and extremely beautiful image. Congrats on the red.</td>', 'Amazing and extremely beautiful image. Congrats on the red.', '2013-11-20 03:02:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132453, 1091291, 52549, '<td valign="top">I love this, it has such a serene beauty. A very well balanced image, I could stare at it for hours. Many, many congrats on your first ribbon and new PB, Kees.</td>', 'I love this, it has such a serene beauty. A very well balanced image, I could stare at it for hours. Many, many congrats on your first ribbon and new PB, Kees.', '2013-11-20 03:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132454, 1091796, 93565, '<td valign="top">I agree there is some weirdness with the color here. The top right of the bench is straight up purple, for instance, and everywhere else appears way saturated.</td>', 'I agree there is some weirdness with the color here. The top right of the bench is straight up purple, for instance, and everywhere else appears way saturated.', '2013-11-20 03:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132455, 1091796, 93565, '<td valign="top">I agree there is some weirdness with the color here. The top right of the bench is straight up purple, for instance, and everywhere else appears way saturated.<br/>ETA: Weirdness with internet, my apologies.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-11-20 03:40:45.</i></td>', 'I agree there is some weirdness with the color here. The top right of the bench is straight up purple, for instance, and everywhere else appears way saturated.ETA: Weirdness with internet, my apologies.', '2013-11-20 03:05:03.000000', '2013-11-20 03:40:45.000000', 0),
(7132456, 1090758, 93565, '<td valign="top">Love the framing with the people but the skewed horizon is troublesome.</td>', 'Love the framing with the people but the skewed horizon is troublesome.', '2013-11-20 03:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132457, 1091778, 93565, '<td valign="top">Regarding your other comment-<br/>Scenes like this are tricky, as you have warmer late day light and cool shadows. If you warm things, you will overcook your oranges and reds (especially on the Nikon sensors I''ve experience with), but keeping them as is will look unnatural. The solution is to warm your shadows selectively or set for your shadows and cool your highlights. I would recommend warming your shadows as my experience has been that Nikon sensors have better leniency on the cool end, not the warm. <br/> <br/>Nice reflections but not a particularly captivating scene.</td>', 'Regarding your other comment-Scenes like this are tricky, as you have warmer late day light and cool shadows. If you warm things, you will overcook your oranges and reds (especially on the Nikon sensors I''ve experience with), but keeping them as is will look unnatural. The solution is to warm your shadows selectively or set for your shadows and cool your highlights. I would recommend warming your shadows as my experience has been that Nikon sensors have better leniency on the cool end, not the warm.  Nice reflections but not a particularly captivating scene.', '2013-11-20 03:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132458, 1091771, 93565, '<td valign="top">I very much enjoy the gradation in the shadows. Very nice.</td>', 'I very much enjoy the gradation in the shadows. Very nice.', '2013-11-20 03:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132459, 1091646, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m okay with the coldness of this. Shame more don''t appreciate "cold nature." Nicely done.</td>', 'I''m okay with the coldness of this. Shame more don''t appreciate "cold nature." Nicely done.', '2013-11-20 03:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132460, 1091596, 93565, '<td valign="top">Don''t ever expect to score well on a shot like this, but I appreciate it. Powerplants and landscapes are a perfect mix, if you ask me.<br/>Thanks for the effort.</td>', 'Don''t ever expect to score well on a shot like this, but I appreciate it. Powerplants and landscapes are a perfect mix, if you ask me.Thanks for the effort.', '2013-11-20 03:15:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132461, 1091786, 93565, '<td valign="top">A total abstract?! No way!<br/> <br/>This is interesting. It feels a bit cool so far as color goes. I''d like things to either be MORE abstract or LESS so. Point us at something to consider, or devolve it all even more. This is in the middle awkward ground here, for me, so far as abstract goes.</td>', 'A total abstract?! No way! This is interesting. It feels a bit cool so far as color goes. I''d like things to either be MORE abstract or LESS so. Point us at something to consider, or devolve it all even more. This is in the middle awkward ground here, for me, so far as abstract goes.', '2013-11-20 03:18:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132462, 1091291, 20608, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon mate, this is a classic image and definitely one for print.</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon mate, this is a classic image and definitely one for print.', '2013-11-20 03:21:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7132463, 1091626, 20608, '<td valign="top">Could even be Mars, superb image, congrats</td>', 'Could even be Mars, superb image, congrats', '2013-11-20 03:21:41.000000', NULL, 0),
